  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased Access To Primary Health Care And Response To Outbreaks Including Cholera To Affected Communities In SNNP Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The response will target outbreak affected SNNP Region, Konso Zone and Amaro special woreda including any emerging locations with emergencies and will be coordinated with respective health bureaus and health cluster with the overall objective to reduce morbidity and mortality and increase capacity of the health bureaus to respond to outbreaks.</narrative>
  </description>
